### =========================================
### SMARTQR - EXCEPTION AND AUTHORIZATION VALIDATION
### FASE 9 - Evidencias de errores y permisos
### =========================================
### Este archivo se mantiene en el repositorio como evidencia de pruebas.
### Ejecutar las peticiones en orden.
### Si el registro de un usuario devuelve 409 porque ya existe,
### continuar con su login correspondiente.
### =========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@ownerEmail = exception.owner@smartqr.com
@otherEmail = exception.other@smartqr.com
@testPassword = Validation123!

### VARIABLES MANUALES DE ESTA PRUEBA
### Ejecuta la petición indicada y copia el valor devuelto aquí arriba.
@validationProductId = PEGA_AQUI_ID_PRODUCTO_DEL_PASO_0
@ownerValidationToken = PEGA_AQUI_TOKEN_CUSTOMER_DEL_PASO_3
@cashValidationOrderId = PEGA_AQUI_ORDER_ID_DEL_PASO_5
@paidValidationOrderId = PEGA_AQUI_ORDER_ID_DEL_PASO_8
@otherValidationToken = PEGA_AQUI_TOKEN_SEGUNDO_CUSTOMER_DEL_PASO_15
@adminValidationToken = PEGA_AQUI_TOKEN_ADMIN_DEL_PASO_20

### =========================================
### A. DATOS BASE Y CUSTOMER PROPIETARIO
### =========================================

### 0. Obtener menu publico
### Copia el id de un producto disponible en @validationProductId.
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/menu
Accept: application/json

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 200 OK


### 1. Registrar customer propietario de pedidos
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Exception Owner Customer",
  "email": "{{ownerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### Resultado esperado en base limpia:
### HTTP 201 Created


### 2. [409] Registrar otra vez el mismo email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Exception Owner Customer Duplicate",
  "email": "{{ownerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 409 Conflict
### message: Cannot register user: this email is already in use.


### 3. Login customer propietario
### Copia access_token en @ownerValidationToken.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{ownerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 200 OK


### =========================================
### B. VALIDACIONES DE DTO Y ERRORES DE PEDIDOS/PAGOS
### =========================================

### 4. [400] Crear pedido con cantidad igual a cero
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerValidationToken}}

{
  "tableNumber": 90,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": {{validationProductId}},
      "quantity": 0,
      "notes": "Debe fallar por cantidad cero"
    }
  ]
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 400 Bad Request
### message contiene: Quantity must be greater than zero


### 5. Crear pedido valido para probar cash insuficiente
### Copia orderId en @cashValidationOrderId.
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerValidationToken}}

{
  "tableNumber": 91,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": {{validationProductId}},
      "quantity": 2,
      "notes": "Pedido para cash insuficiente"
    }
  ]
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 201 Created


### 6. [400] Solicitar pago cash insuficiente
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/cash/request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerValidationToken}}

{
  "orderId": {{cashValidationOrderId}},
  "cashReceived": 0.01
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 400 Bad Request
### error: Bad Request
### message contiene: cash received must be equal to or greater than the order total.


### 7. [404] Consultar pedido inexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/999999999
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerValidationToken}}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 404 Not Found
### message: Order not found with ID: 999999999


### 8. Crear pedido valido para probar pago repetido
### Copia orderId en @paidValidationOrderId.
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerValidationToken}}

{
  "tableNumber": 92,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": {{validationProductId}},
      "quantity": 1,
      "notes": "Pedido para pago repetido"
    }
  ]
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 201 Created


### 9. Pagar correctamente el pedido con tarjeta
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/card
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerValidationToken}}

{
  "orderId": {{paidValidationOrderId}},
  "cardHolderName": "Exception Owner Customer",
  "last4Digits": "4242",
  "transactionId": "validation-first-payment"
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 201 Created
### paymentStatus: COMPLETED
### paymentMethod: CARD


### 10. [409] Intentar pagar de nuevo el mismo pedido
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/card
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerValidationToken}}

{
  "orderId": {{paidValidationOrderId}},
  "cardHolderName": "Exception Owner Customer",
  "last4Digits": "4242",
  "transactionId": "validation-duplicate-payment"
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 409 Conflict
### message contiene: this order is already paid or unavailable.


### 11. [401] Acceder con un JWT invalido
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{paidValidationOrderId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer invalid.jwt.token.for.validation

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 401 Unauthorized
### message: Authentication token is invalid or expired.


### =========================================
### C. FEEDBACK E IA - VALIDACIONES SIN LLAMAR AL MODELO
### =========================================

### 12. [400] Enviar feedback con rating fuera de rango
### La validacion ocurre antes de invocar OpenAI.
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerValidationToken}}

{
  "orderId": {{paidValidationOrderId}},
  "rating": 8,
  "comment": "Este comentario no debe llegar al analisis IA porque el rating es invalido."
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 400 Bad Request
### message contiene: Rating must be at most 5


### 13. [400] Solicitar recomendacion IA con presupuesto invalido
### La validacion ocurre antes de invocar OpenAI.
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/combo-recommendation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerValidationToken}}

{
  "preferences": "Quiero compartir una bebida.",
  "maxBudget": 0.50,
  "numberOfPeople": 2
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 400 Bad Request
### message contiene: Maximum budget must be at least 1.00 EUR


### =========================================
### D. FORBIDDEN REAL: OTRO CUSTOMER
### =========================================

### 14. Registrar segundo customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Exception Other Customer",
  "email": "{{otherEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### Resultado esperado en base limpia:
### HTTP 201 Created


### 15. Login segundo customer
### Copia access_token en @otherValidationToken.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{otherEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 200 OK


### 16. [403] Segundo customer intenta consultar pedido del propietario
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{paidValidationOrderId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{otherValidationToken}}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 403 Forbidden
### message contiene: this order does not belong to the authenticated customer.


### 17. [403] Segundo customer intenta enviar feedback sobre pedido ajeno
### El servicio rechaza ownership antes de invocar OpenAI.
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{otherValidationToken}}

{
  "orderId": {{paidValidationOrderId}},
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "No deberia poder valorar el pedido de otro cliente."
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 403 Forbidden
### message contiene: this order does not belong to the authenticated customer.


### 18. [403] Customer intenta consultar dashboard de ADMIN
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/metrics
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerValidationToken}}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 403 Forbidden
### Esta denegacion procede de RBAC porque CUSTOMER no tiene rol ADMIN.


### 19. [403] Customer intenta utilizar agente local de ADMIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/local/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerValidationToken}}

{
  "question": "Resume las ventas actuales."
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 403 Forbidden
### Ollama no debe ser invocado porque el rol no esta autorizado.


### =========================================
### E. ADMIN - VALIDACION DE RECURSO Y DTO LOCAL
### =========================================

### 20. Login administrador
### Copia access_token en @adminValidationToken.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin@smartqr.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 200 OK


### 21. [404] Admin intenta actualizar producto inexistente
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/999999999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminValidationToken}}

{
  "name": "Producto de validacion",
  "description": "Este producto no debe guardarse",
  "price": 2.50,
  "category": "MONTADITO",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/validation.png"
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 404 Not Found
### message: Product not found with ID: 999999999


### 22. [400] Admin invoca agente local con pregunta vacia
### La validacion ocurre antes de invocar Ollama.
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/local/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminValidationToken}}

{
  "question": ""
}

### Resultado esperado:
### HTTP 400 Bad Request
### message contiene: Question is required